CalldataSliceLib::sliceBytes32
├── given valid bytes32 at start
│   ├── it should return correct value
│   └── it should return offset + 32
├── given bytes32 at offset
│   ├── it should read from correct position
│   └── it should return offset + 32
├── given max value (all 0xFF)
│   └── it should handle max value correctly
└── given sequential reads
    └── it should read each value correctly with advancing offset